          "When access blocks the work, name the system, role, and approver. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. Preserve both values and the time each was observed. Do not let a deadline expand a role beyond its written limit. A sample payment plan compliance review checks plan terms, approval matrix, and the surviving value in the collections file. A payment plan compliance handoff at Invoicing Specialists ends only when the next reviewer can act from the written record."
