          "Reopen the case when the destination value is disputed. Record the approximate value, the approver, and the final check time. Do not mark complete until the check is repeatable by another reviewer. The next reviewer should not have to ask which document is authoritative. In this payment plan compliance case, the record points to the collections file and names the collections lead as the decision owner. At Invoicing Specialists, the payment plan compliance queue marks a held invoice with the reason it stopped and the person who can release it."
