          "Check whether the definition changed during the period. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Use case-level review to explain an outlier before calling it a trend. Report a null result as clearly as a positive one. For payment plan compliance, the working file keeps plan terms and approval matrix beside the decision note. Invoicing Specialists keeps the payment plan compliance source, reviewer, and decision date together in the collections file so a later check does not depend on memory."
